+// GIN Q4 (research build): device-side error-CQE classification + host mailbox.
+// Active only when the GPU context's `fault` pointer is set (host env
+// NCCL_GIN_FAULT_CLASSIFY=1); otherwise every path below is the stock one.
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
